Wrong (B): The full $25,000 cannot be deducted because it exceeds the shareholder''s combined stock and debt basis of $10,000.
Wrong (C): The loss is not permanently disallowed; $10,000 is currently deductible and the excess is suspended, not lost.
Wrong (D): The suspended portion carries forward indefinitely under Sec. 1366(d)(2), not for only 5 years.$EXPL$
