UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Sec. 752(a), a partner''s share of recourse liabilities is determined by economic risk of loss, not profit-sharing ratios. Partner N bears 60% of $300,000 ($180,000), increasing outside basis from $200,000 to $380,000. Reg. Sec. 1.752-2 makes N''s risk-sharing agreement controlling.
