-- Q4209: Advanced Basis Calculations [medium/L1]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): The Section 743(b) basis adjustment is personal to the transferee (buyer) of the partnership interest. It adjusts the buyer''s share of partnership inside basis to match their outside basis, but only for the buyer''s benefit. Other partners'' shares are unaffected. See Sec. 754 and Sec. 743(b).
Wrong (A): The adjustment does not apply equally to all partners; it is specific to the transferee and tracked separately by the partnership.
Wrong (B): The adjustment does not apply to the partnership as a whole; it is a partner-specific adjustment affecting only the buyer''s allocations.
Wrong (C): The transferor (seller) has sold the interest and no longer holds a partnership interest; the adjustment benefits only the buyer.$EXPL$
WHERE id = 4209;

